 "source_type": "primary", "author": "脱脱等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/cfe7117a41b196f8984cd77f8ab5e4ebfe68ddf8/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-284/year-0944/part-04/sources/library/songshi-269-yang-flood-advice/source.txt", "note": "《宋史》卷269·杨昭俭传·堵河与谏刻碑，段落 songshi-9c6e46fee832-p058816；已核卷号、上下文与传主，EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "id": "1a83aeae-349c-54a2-abde-f94cbc3ad36a"}, {"title": "资治通鉴·后晋纪五", "source_type": "primary", "author": "司马光等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/cfe7117a41b196f8984cd77f8ab5e4ebfe68ddf8/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-284/year-0944/part-04/sources/library/tongjian-284-944-august-november/source.txt", "note": "《资治通鉴》后晋纪五，段落 zizhi-tongjian-a63549944a71-p003376；电子底本待考，分段待核", "id": "7b81686a-069d-5e08-b61f-fd92146983f9"}, {"title": "新五代史·卷29·桑维翰传·恢复枢密与学士", "source_type": "primary", "author": "欧阳修", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/cfe7117a41b196f8984cd77f8ab5e4ebfe68ddf8/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-284/year-0944/part-04/sources/library/xinwudaishi-029-sang-restoration/source.txt", "note": "《新五代史》卷29·桑维翰传·恢复枢密与学士，段落 xin-wudaishi-b08f244b9241-p001060；已核卷号、上下文与传主，EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "id": "7ed53ccd-8504-5ad3-bb9a-2bf839501449"}, {"title": "新五代史·卷50·折从阮传·初名与抗契丹", "source_type": "primary", "author": "欧阳修", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/cfe7117a41b196f8984cd77f8ab5e4ebfe68ddf8/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-284/year-0944/part-04/sources/library/xinwudaishi-050-zhe-congruan/source.txt", "note": "《新五代史》卷50·折从阮传·初名与抗契丹，段落 xin-wudaishi-b08f244b9241-p001956；已核卷号、上下文与传主，EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "id": "11116a2c-16d7-53e1-b50b-1838e0072633"}, {"title": "资治通鉴·卷284·天福九年与开运元年·五月至八月及追述", "source_type": "primary", "author": "司马光等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/bffff83c141adc9ef801434ad426164254e